// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`GC renders a mixed resource report in its established order 1`] = `
"Dead project entries (1):
  /gone/app
Orphaned workspace directories (1):
  /h/workspaces/wt--0123456789abcdef - 8K
              recorded project root /gone/wt is gone and no registry entry names it
              --delete re-checks each directory, then removes it whole.
Parked simulators (1, 2K):
  ios stim-parked (PARK..) iPhone 17 26.5 parked 24h ago 2K
              --delete attempts verified deletions and keeps failures.
Orphaned devices (1):
  android stim-orphan (stim-orphan) - 2K on disk
Stale device records (1) - the device is gone, the project is not:
  ios GONE is not on this machine
              recorded by /app
              --delete clears the RECORD only; there is no device left to touch.
Orphaned EAS sessions (1) - current EAS project only:
  stim-remote (S1) [ios, running]
              project scope: /app
              remedy: eas simulator:stop --id S1
Stale build locks (1) - the process that was building is gone:
  ios abcdef.. (pid 123 is not running)
              started by /builder
EAS session sweep notices (1):
  one session could not be verified
Skipped (1) - not classified as dead:
  /Volumes/Offline/app: volume /Volumes/Offline is not mounted
Shared build caches (2) - alive, not garbage:
         12K  Workspace build outputs (detected)
              /h/workspaces
              derived-data, gradle-build, android-cas, cache-provider of each workspace; workspace.json, state.json, logs and device records stay
              The next build of an unchanged app installs from the shared build cache; after a native change the compilation cache speeds the rebuild, but on React Native 0.86 Swift does not use it (explicit modules are off), so that build recompiles Swift.
          8K  /w/a (idle 4d)
                would be CLEARED
          4K  /w/b (last use unknown)
                kept: in use: its dev server supervisor (pid 7) is running
          4K  Build cache (registered)
              /cache/build
              a test cache
  total: 16K
  would clear the build outputs of 1 workspace (8K)"
`;

